; Room 34 ($22): Top Landing
;
; Format: see #R$C000.
; .
; Border: blue (1). Conveyor: none. Ramp: 7 cells from row 11 column 17 up to
; row 5 column 23, rising to the right.
; .
; Items (from the item table at #R$A400): 1, at row 9 column 2.
; .
; Exits: left Room 35 (Master Bedroom, #R$E300); right Room 33 (The Bathroom,
; #R$E100); up Room 40 (Dr Jones will never believe this, #R$E800); down Room
; 28 (First Landing, #R$DC00). Odd: the down exit of Room 40 is Room 0, not
; this room.
; .
; Entities: slot 0: definition $3A (at $A1D0) start $86; slot 1: definition
; $13 (at $A098) start $6C; slot 2: definition $24 (at $A120) start $10. List
; ends at slot 3 ($FF).
@label=RoomTopLanding
